    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Some of the deepest love lives in ordinary things.⁠\n⁠\nThe rides home.⁠\nThe meals waiting.⁠\nThe small sacrifices we were too young to understand.⁠\n⁠\nSo much of what shaped us never announced itself.⁠\nIt just kept showing up.⁠\n⁠\nAnd years later, we realize—⁠\nwe carry those quiet kinds of love with us everywhere.⁠\n⁠\nxx Atticus⁠\n⁠\n🖤 Send this to someone who helped raise you.",
